> Walked around Lake Merritt[.] Played two hours of the text adventure Fire[bird]. Took BART into SF and[ went] to dinner at Pane[ e Vino] with my father's brother's ex-wife and her new boyfriend,[ a] widower from a[ 55]-year marriage[.]
